flowchart TB
    accTitle: Keys, encrypted files and the sign-in gate
    accDescr: In config v4 the Master Password derives an Argon2id KEK, while a random Recovery Key supplies an independent KEK. Separate authenticated config slots wrap the same 256-bit DEK. The DEK decrypts vault data and the separate sign-in Authenticator secret using different contexts. TOTP gates ordinary app login but does not participate in key derivation. Recovery access validates data for reset without granting a login.
    password["SECRET: Master Password"]:::secret --> derive["Argon2id: 3 passes, 64 MiB, p=2\nRandom 32-byte salt from Master slot"]
    derive --> master["KEY: 256-bit Master KEK"]:::key
    recovery["KEY: random 256-bit Recovery Key\nRK1 text decodes to a separate KEK"]:::key
    master --> unwrapMaster["AES-GCM unwrap\nmaster-dek context"]
    masterSlot[(".config MasterKeySlot\nEncrypted DEK + KDF parameters")]:::encrypted --> unwrapMaster
    recovery --> unwrapRecovery["AES-GCM unwrap\nrecovery-dek context"]
    recoverySlot[(".config RecoveryKeySlot\nIndependently encrypted DEK")]:::encrypted --> unwrapRecovery
    unwrapMaster --> dek["KEY: same random 256-bit DEK"]:::key
    unwrapRecovery --> dek
    dek --> vault["Authenticate and decrypt\nvault context"]
    storage[(".storage\nEncrypted VaultData")]:::encrypted --> vault
    vault --> entries["SECRET: entries and groups\nDecrypted only in process memory"]:::secret
    dek --> auth["Authenticate and decrypt\ntotp-secret context"]
    totp[(".config EncryptedTotpSecret")]:::encrypted --> auth
    auth --> gate["Normal sign-in: verify current OTP\nStart login only after both checks"]
    unwrapRecovery -.-> reset["Recovery path: validate, reset credentials\nClear session; return to sign-in"]
    classDef secret fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#d97706,color:#0f172a
    classDef key fill:#ffffff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#0f172a,stroke-dasharray:4 3
    classDef encrypted fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#0f172a
